	| Region                     | United States                        |         | |
	| Status                     | Active                               |         | |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Prokor - ${staticCompanyName}" and the following values
	| Code | PROKOR                        | |
	| Name | Prokor - ${staticCompanyName} | |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Onepro - ${staticProjectName}"
	And I should be able to view a postal address on koroneiki for the account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" with the street address "123 Main Street" with the following values
	| Country               | United States   |
	| Locality              | Los Angeles     |
	| Region                | California      |
	| Postal Code           | 90011           |
	| Street Address Line 1 | 123 Main Street |
	And I should not be able to view a postal address on koroneiki for the account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" with the street address "456 Fake Street"
	And the external link with the entity id "00000000000thisisaprooneacc" and domain "salesforce" should be present on the account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce                  |
	| Entity Id   | 00000000000thisisaprooneacc |
	| Entity Name | account                     |
	And the external link with the entity id "${staticDossieraProjectKey}" and domain "dossiera" should be present on the account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" with the following values
	| Domain      | dossiera                    |
	| Entity Id   | ${staticDossieraProjectKey} |
	| Entity Name | project                     |
	And the external link with the entity id "${staticSalesforceProjectKey}" should be present on the account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce                    |
	| Entity Id   | ${staticSalesforceProjectKey} |
	| Entity Name | project                       |
	And the external link with the entity id "00000000000thisisaprooneacc" and domain "salesforce" should be present on the account "Proone - ${staticCompanyName}" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce                  |
	| Entity Id   | 00000000000thisisaprooneacc |
	| Entity Name | account                     |
	And the external link with the entity id "00000000000thisisaprooneacc" and domain "dossiera" should be present on the account "Proone - ${staticCompanyName}" with the following values
	| Domain      | dossiera                    |
	| Entity Id   | 00000000000thisisaprooneacc |
	| Entity Name | account                     |
	And the external link with the entity id "${staticDossieraAccountKey}" and domain "salesforce" should be present on the account "Prokor - ${staticCompanyName}" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce                  |
	| Entity Id   | ${staticDossieraAccountKey} |
	| Entity Name | account                     |
	And the external link with the entity id "${staticDossieraAccountKey}" and domain "dossiera" should be present on the account "Prokor - ${staticCompanyName}" with the following values
	| Domain      | dossiera                    |
	| Entity Id   | ${staticDossieraAccountKey} |
	| Entity Name | account                     |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken" and the following values
	| Email Address | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | PRO                                  |
	| Last Name     | Koroneiki1                           |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "pro.koroneiki2@lrcustomer.com.broken" and the following values
	| Email Address | pro.koroneiki2@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | PRO                                  |
	| Last Name     | Koroneiki2                           |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "pro.koroneiki3@lrcustomer.com.broken" and the following values
	| Email Address | pro.koroneiki3@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | PRO                                  |
	| Last Name     | Koroneiki3                           |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "pro.koroneiki4@lrcustomer.com.broken" and the following values
	| Email Address | pro.koroneiki4@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | PRO                                  |
	| Last Name     | Koroneiki4                           |
	And the external link with the entity id "${staticSalesforceOpportunityKey}" should be present on the product purchase made by account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" for the product "DXP Production" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce                        |
	| Entity Id   | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityKey} |
	| Entity Name | opportunity                       |
	And the external link with the entity id "${staticSalesforceOpportunityKey}" should be present on the product purchase made by account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" for the product "Platinum Subscription" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce                        |
	| Entity Id   | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityKey} |
	| Entity Name | opportunity                       |
	And the external link with the entity id "${staticSalesforceOpportunityKey}" should be present on the product purchase made by account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" for the product "Portal Production" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce                        |
	| Entity Id   | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityKey} |
	| Entity Name | opportunity                       |
	And the external link with the entity id "${staticSalesforceOpportunityKey}" should be present on the product purchase made by account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" for the product "Gold Subscription" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce                        |
	| Entity Id   | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityKey} |
	| Entity Name | opportunity                       |
	And the contact with the email address "pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" should have the contact role "Support User"
	And the contact with the email address "pro.koroneiki2@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" should have the contact role "Liferay Sales"
	And the contact with the email address "pro.koroneiki2@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" should not have the contact role "Secondary Contact"
	And the contact with the email address "pro.koroneiki3@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" should have the contact role "Support User"
	And the contact with the email address "pro.koroneiki4@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" should have the contact role "Liferay Sales"
	And the contact with the email address "pro.koroneiki4@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" should have the contact role "Secondary Contact"
	And I should be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" for the product "DXP Production" with the following values
	| Quantity | 1        | |
	| Status   | Approved | |
	And I should be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" for the product "Platinum Subscription" with the following values
	| Quantity | 1        | |
	| Status   | Approved | |
	And I should be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" for the product "Portal Production" with the following values
	| Quantity | 1        | |
	| Status   | Approved | |
	And I should be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" for the product "Gold Subscription" with the following values
	| Quantity | 1        | |
	| Status   | Approved | |
	When I log into the provisioning homepage as "${staticKoroneikiAdminEmailAddress}" with password "${staticKoroneikiAdminPassword}"
	And I go to the account index page
	And I search the accounts page using the keyword "Korpro"
	And I click on the account with the name "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" on the provisioning index
	And I click on the Sync To Zendesk button on the account page
	Then the support organization with the code "PROKORKORPRO" should be part of the support site
	When I wait for "3" minutes
	Then the organization "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" should be present on zendesk.liferay.com
	And the account with the name "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" should have "4" external links
	And the account with the name "Prokor - ${staticCompanyName}" should have "2" external links
	And the account with the name "Proone - ${staticCompanyName}" should have "2" external links

